# LaTeX build byproducts. The .tex and .pdf are kept — they are the artifacts that get sent
# somewhere — but these carry no information that the sources do not, and they churn on every
# single rebuild. (*.log is already ignored repo-wide.)
*.aux
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
